  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania avocado supply chain mapping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study aims to provide an overview of Tanzania&apos;s avocado sector by mapping out how it is structured through a holistic supply chain approach. This study will shed light on the challenges the local supply chain actors are facing and the export potential but also showcase data gaps for growth, efficiencies, and needs by supply chain actors and display opportunities for innovative solution providers to enter the sector. The desired outcome of the study is to stimulate supply chain actors, direct and indirect beneficiaries, to engage and adopt solutions and recommendations. Ultimately, this can catalyse the sector&apos;s export potential and solidify Tanzanian avocado&apos;s competitiveness in the global market.</narrative>
  </description>
